y@github.com> 1663363042 -0700\n\nfix(hybrid): Add silo mode to \"model exists\" conditions (#38836)\n\nIn several places where the existence of a model is checked via\r\n`app_config.get_model`, replace with a new utility function that also\r\nchecks whether the model is available in the current silo mode.\r\n\r\nPromote the `__silo_limit` meta-attributes to publicly visible\r\nattributes, dropping the leading underscores.", "verified_at": "2024-01-16T19:59:59Z"}}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/getsentry/sentry/commits/729b8112ebd7becdcecb503ba62bd69d97163efa", "html_url": "https://github.com/getsentry/sentry/commit/729b8112ebd7becdcecb503ba62bd69d97163efa", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/getsentry/sentry/commits/729b8112ebd7becdcecb503ba62bd69d97163efa/comments", "author": {"login": "RyanSkonnord", "id": 26411900, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjI2NDExOTAw", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26411900?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/RyanSkonnord", "html_url": "https://github.com/RyanSkonnord", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/RyanSkonnord/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/RyanSkonnord/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/RyanSkonnord/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/RyanSkonnord/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/RyanSkonnord/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/RyanSkonnord/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/RyanSkonnord/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/RyanSkonnord/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/RyanSkonnord/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "committer": {"login": "web-flow", "id": 19864447, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow", "html_url": "https://github.com/web-flow", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "parents": [{"sha": "3c5deccf888f723f64f27ea73e34bd9047477947", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/getsentry/sentry/commits/3c5deccf888f723f64f27ea73e34bd9047477947", "html_url": "https://github.com/getsentry/sentry/commit/3c5deccf888f723f64f27ea73e34bd9047477947"}]}, {"sha": "e15af7965b42dbe5d97e69f2e9ead24f6ab41874", "node_id": "C_kwDOAA1TcNoAKGUxNWFmNzk2NWI0MmRiZTVkOTdlNjlmMmU5ZWFkMjRmNmFiNDE4NzQ", "commit": {"author": {"name": "Ryan Skonnord", "email": "ryan.skonnord@sentry.io", "date": "2022-09-09T17:36:45Z"}, "committer": {"name": "GitHub", "email": "noreply@github.com", "date": "2022-09-09T17:36:45Z"}, "message": "ref(hybrid): Rename customer silo to \"region silo\" (#38638)\n\nIn practice, we found that \"customer\" sounds too much like \"control\" and\r\nwas easy to confuse with it. \"Region\" here isn't intended to mean\r\nstrictly a geographic region, but can also mean a region of SaaS service\r\nin which a single-tenant customer is isolated.", "tree": {"sha": "9f60ba9c7d80276a8f626179e187c7092d50627f", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/getsentry/sentry/git/trees/9f60ba9c7d80276a8f626179e187c7092d50627f"}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/getsentry/sentry/git/commits/e15af7965b42dbe5d97e69f2e9ead24f6ab41874", "comment_count": 0, "verification": {"verified": true, "reason": "valid", "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsBcBAABCAAQBQJjG3mtCRBK7hj4Ov3rIwAAq7oIABXSd+BmFF8JJDKglFoa2ifA\nYTq7/JRti3jJHj7oT09WtL7Mt1EkWK2eXynD8vxkP/EywQqraQimceUDYmdV0OWc\nBUxjOVOTNGNmZ4KwohRDhSoqy0RI/vN7z4s4QZy3Qjq2eoUab8nrwFHXdYGQNIi+\nfCUGYls+sR9Ii0GS42NoQxVd4WY3+th5FSVxFCK+QPjQLqG3gvvMRS1Met4H76ot\nfc9BLUsmPXtEaoWWZaSOhbjxRnR1nW6FfzaiLddCRDaBuXtxpkv+b0Y9dYFJgj1Z\nrL0WhymsP/1SHL8rXvxKbKl5etDw2D60kWYSBBCe4yD8EDcfBPqsgZkCd8FW488=\n=nuKT\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n", "payload": "tree 9f60ba9c7d80276a8f626179e187c7092d50627f\nparent 1a45bd8519b8bf29111a782b4ed90b35d0bc8411\nauthor Ryan Skonnord <ryan.skonnord@sentry.io> 1662745005 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1662745005 -0700\n\nref(hybrid): Rename customer silo to \"region silo\" (#38638)\n\nIn practice, we found that \"customer\" sounds too much like \"control\" and\r\nwas easy to confuse with it. \"Region\" here isn't intended to mean\r\nstrictly a geographic region, but can also mean a region of SaaS service\r\nin which a single-tenant customer is isolated.", "verified_at": "2024-11-12T21:45:57Z"}}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/getsentry/sentry/commits/e15af7965b42dbe5d97e69f2e9ead24f6ab41874", "html_url": "https://github.com/getsentry/sentry/commit/e15af7965b42dbe5d97e69f2e9ead24f6ab41874", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/getsentry/sentry/commits/e15af7965b42dbe5d97e69f2e9ead24f6ab41874/comments", "author": {"login": "RyanSkonnord", "id": 26411900, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjI2NDExOTAw", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26411900?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/RyanSkonnord", "html_url": "https://github.com/RyanSkonnord", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/RyanSkonnord/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/RyanSkonnord/following{/other_user}", "gists_url"